== Walkthrough ==

''[[Hanns Krieghor]] is located at 31, 149 under Crow's Tavern in North Qeynos, amongst the Circle of the Unseen Hands.''

You say, 'Hail, Hanns Krieghor'

: Hanns Krieghor says, 'My name is Hanns..  Do as I say. and we shall get along just fine.'

'''Hand [[Hanns Krieghor]] your [[Napkin from Crow's]]'''

:: ''Napkin from Crow's reads:''

:: <code>An unseen hand from the shadows beckons you into the darkness. Hanns Krieghor has need of your skills. Take this note to Hanns, and he shall instruct you further. Go to Crow's.  Your entryway into the unseen lies behind the painting. Tread carefully, the obvious path is the wrong path.  Feel the walls for safe passage to the hideout</code>

:  Hanns Krieghor says, 'Lucky thing you weren't followed, or you'd be breathing through holes in your back right now.  Remember, we keep our business quiet, so watch yourself, sewer crawler.'

